      <title>安迪·奥格尔斯在田纳西州输给了共和党挑战者</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/andy-ogles-loses-tennessee-primary-charlie-hatcher.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[奥格尔斯曾担任两届国会议员，尽管存在争议，但他之前也曾阻止过主要威胁。但周四，前州农业专员查理·哈切尔(Charlie Hatcher)却表达了不满。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/andy-ogles-loses-tennessee-primary-charlie-hatcher.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 03:57:56 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>新墨西哥州法官责令 Meta 支付 5.67 亿美元罚款</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/technology/meta-new-mexico-child-safety.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[陪审团发现 Meta 在其平台的安全性方面误导用户，并下令处以 3.75 亿美元的罚款，而该处罚是由州法官判处的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/technology/meta-new-mexico-child-safety.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 02:48:36 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>布莱克本赢得共和党田纳西州州长提名</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/elections/marsha-blackburn-tennessee-governor-primary.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[参议员玛莎·布莱克本 (Marsha Blackburn) 轻松击败了两位共和党竞争对手，现在有望成为 11 月选举后该州第一位女州长。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/elections/marsha-blackburn-tennessee-governor-primary.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 02:02:26 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普签署针对出生公民权和“生育旅游”的行政命令</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/trump-birthright-citizenship-tourism.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这些命令是在最高法院于 6 月 30 日裁定特朗普总统之前终止出生公民权的努力违宪之后发布的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/trump-birthright-citizenship-tourism.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 01:03:06 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>这个人工智能刚刚创造的病毒在自然界中没有发现</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/science/ai-viruses-bacteria-arc.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[科学家们在 DNA 库上训练人工智能，然后要求该模型为病毒基因组创建配方。其中十六个是可行的，产生了新病毒。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/science/ai-viruses-bacteria-arc.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:30:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>一些众议院共和党人支持科里·米尔斯竞选连任的挑战者</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/republicans-endorse-cory-mills-opponent.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[两名共和党议员支持了众议员科里·米尔斯 (Cory Mills) 的主要对手，米尔斯被指控袭击并正在接受众议院道德委员会的调查。]]></description>
