    <item>
      <title>特朗普对电子产品和太阳能电池板的关键成分征收关税</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/trump-tariffs-solar-panels.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[美国政府将对多晶硅（半导体和太阳能电池板的关键部件）实行最低进口价格，并对用该材料制成的产品征收关税。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/trump-tariffs-solar-panels.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 21:53:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>米奇·麦康奈尔从康复机构出院</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/06/us/politics/mitch-mcconnell-discharged-hospitalization-senate.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这位肯塔基州共和党人在出现健康问题后已经缺席国会近两个月了。他表示，他将继续在家中康复。]]></description>
